{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aMilk way Subway \u300bis a 2D sci-fi suspense RPG and puzzle game. Humanity has developed a new habitable zone in  universe. The story begins with a hacking accident named [ember]. The collective failure of the networked devices caused great damage and casualties, and at the same time a mysterious 20-sided polyhedron- UD3718. you will play a role named Millai, joined a scientific research organization called \u201cC.O.S.M.I.C.\u201d to pursue the truth of the accident that took your mother's life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meetings, trust, betrayal, confrontation; inhuman research, difficult puzzles, time and space entanglements, non-carbon-based civilizations... As for how to face these \u201ctruths\u201d and the even more confusing so-called \u201cdestiny\u201d behind them, it may be the first step you really need to take ......</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745440/extras/35df65a45702a2a19bdbb6c5406bb820.avif?t=1753409321\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745440/extras_big/35df65a45702a2a19bdbb6c5406bb820.avif?t=1753409321 width=800 height=94 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  The story begins with a large-scale cyber hacking accident called EMBER - \u201cgifts\u201d  from the cosmic, intercepted \u201cprophecies\u201d signal, illusion... Behind these mysteries, you'll go on a journey across time and space. The clouds of suspicion expand with the adventure, and the truth of the accident is even more confusing. ......<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745440/extras/7bb6d7d36356419f5c0250fe1b0722b8.poster.avif?t=1753409321\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745440/extras/7bb6d7d36356419f5c0250fe1b0722b8.webm?t=1753409321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745440/extras/7bb6d7d36356419f5c0250fe1b0722b8.mp4?t=1753409321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745440/extras/871c83565f00d2a7f6a6b56bbddef207.avif?t=1753409321\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745440/extras_big/871c83565f00d2a7f6a6b56bbddef207.avif?t=1753409321 width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player hacks the device to obtain clues in the form of puzzles. The puzzles allow the player to control two entangled particles with different spin directions, which will move in different directions. The player needs to make full use of the mechanism to get them to the specified location. Solved puzzles can light up stars on the panel to advance the plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745440/extras/fc76ceb132156d227e1bdf0927db2514.poster.avif?t=1753409321\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745440/extras/fc76ceb132156d227e1bdf0927db2514.webm?t=1753409321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745440/extras/fc76ceb132156d227e1bdf0927db2514.mp4?t=1753409321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745440/extras/a376ef2c87ff9ef4cc399978bf63b6c3.avif?t=1753409321\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745440/extras_big/a376ef2c87ff9ef4cc399978bf63b6c3.avif?t=1753409321 width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player play the role named miallai, a novice researcher seeking the truth of the ember incident, where she sees a figure that seems to be familiar but also completely unfamiliar. The team leader, Octo, who is usually a jokester but has a sense of justice in critical moments\uff0cseems to remind her of the young girl with star-like eyes in her childhood memories. What will be the story of their fated encounter?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745440/extras/d7906afd87b41e1efcd1fef9af97e38d.avif?t=1753409321\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745440/extras_big/d7906afd87b41e1efcd1fef9af97e38d.avif?t=1753409321 width=800 height=448 /></span><br>Staff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art/developer Plasmafall</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >copywriter Ada Oakrin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >music Yolanda</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TA grey the fish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >twi/x\uff1a@plasmafall</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2745440?t=1753409321","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2745440?t=1753409321","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745440/f7240c8cc7fb4a5c60dff2ae1c923666add5cdc2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753409321","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745440/f7240c8cc7fb4a5c60dff2ae1c923666add5cdc2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753409321","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":